05ob06re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Talk about your favorite foods.", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le05ob06re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le05ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le05ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le05ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tGood evening, Miss. Welcome to Bistro 88. Would you like to hear our specials?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>:\tSure. I'm really hungry!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tTonight we have an amazing salad with seasonal vegetables and goat cheese, and a shepherd's pie. In my opinion, it is to die for. <br/>\nJessica:\tHmm \u2026 Shepherd's pie. I have not eaten that in a while.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tYou won't regret it, trust me. <br/>\nJessica:\tOK then. Can I ask you a question? I noticed you have a South American accent. If you don't mind me asking, where are you from?"}, {"time": "30000", "image": "engenn8le05ob06re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tI don't mind at all. I am a Colombian. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>:\tNo way! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tWhat do you mean?\t<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>:\tOh, you say that when you're very surprised. I suppose some expressions are lost in translation. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tI see. I should learn more phrases like these! What will you do in Colombia?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: \tI'm supposed to spend a year there with an exchange program. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tYou'll love it there. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>:\tI heard that you shouldn't leave any food uneaten if you're invited to someone's house. Is that true?"}, {"time": "56000", "image": "engenn8le05ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tYes. We try to be accommodating to foreigners, but our elders feel uncomfortable about it. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>:\tI'll remember that, thanks. I'm supposed to live with a family in Bogota. I'll try not to upset them too much!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tYou'll be Ok. Many Colombians would rather defuse the situation when an argument arises. We like to focus our public displays of emotions on something positive, like dancing.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>:\tOh! I can't wait for that ..."}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio"}]}], "type": "sena"}